 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nA Romantic Honeymoon Safari and Zanzibar Retreat\nENQUIRE NOW\n\n$8650pp\n\n*price based on 2 people sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nJun- Sept\n\nDURATION\n\n12 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater, Zanzibar\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\nEmbark on a captivating 12-day honeymoon journey through the unparalleled landscapes of Tanzania. Immerse yourself in thrilling safaris across the country's most iconic national parks, where you’ll encounter Africa's famed wildlife. Afterward, indulge in the serene beauty of Zanzibar's pristine beaches. This journey offers an exquisite blend of romance, adventure, and relaxation, creating memories to cherish for a lifetime.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3\nDay 4\nDay 5\nDay 6\nDay 7\nDay 8-11\nDay 12\n​\n\nDay 1: Arrival in Arusha\nArrive in Arusha and meet your representative and driver guide at the airport. Transfer to the luxurious Gran Meliá for a relaxing evening, enjoying views of Mount Meru and Mount Kilimanjaro, if weather permits. Optional activities like Lake Duluti canoeing, yoga classes, and city tours are available (additional cost).\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast\n\nAccomodation\n\n5* Gran Meliá Arusha\n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Ngorongoro Crater Fee, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari;\n\n• Accommodation in Zanzibar \n\n• Local flight from Arusha Airport – Zanzibar \n\n• Zanzibar airport transfers \n\n• Masai Boma visit (Complimentary)\n\n• Balloon Safari in Serengeti\n\n• Flying doctor \n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\n• Activities in Zanzibar\n\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
